SEL relays: fixed settings parsing crashes on lines before the first section, files without an ``[INFO]`` section, single-letter ``[D]`` and ``[M]`` sections, and non-numeric values such as ``REQ`` and ``OFF``. Fixed ``RELAYTYPE`` model parsing (e.g. ``0710``), event file detection matching unrelated filenames, ``ESNTP``/``EDNP`` values reported as disabled, ``[STORAGE]`` files being ignored, and ``[DNPA]``/``[DNPB]`` maps creating bogus I/O points.
